## Command

```shell
biome lint '<TEMP_DIR>/plugin_includes_in_overrides_are_anchored_to_project_directory'
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "overrides": [
    {
      "includes": ["src/**", "!src/vendor/**"],
      "plugins": [
        {
          "path": "./no-assign.grit",
          "includes": ["src/**", "!src/generated/**"]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

## `lib/index.js`

```js
Object.assign({}, value);

```

## `no-assign.grit`

```grit
`Object.assign($args)` where {
    register_diagnostic(span = $args, message = "Prefer object spread")
}
```

## `packages/app/src/index.js`

```js
Object.assign({}, value);

```

